#. module: approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval.field_approval_approver__decision_date
msgid ""
"When THIS approver personally approved or refused, stamped by the decision "
"funnel (_apply_decision). Left empty for rows flipped by non-decisions — "
"consent auto-approval, sequential/cascade refusal, owner cancellation, "
"expiration — so the approver-performance analytics count only genuine "
"decisions and measure each approver's own response time (cleared on withdraw"
" and reset-to-draft)."
msgstr ""

#. module: approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval.field_approval_approver__pending_since
msgid ""
"When this row ENTERED the decision window (state became 'pending'). The "
"symmetric half of decision_date, which records when it left. Approver-"
"response analytics measure decision_date - pending_since so they report THIS"
" approver's turnaround; measuring against the request's date_confirmed "
"instead charged every approver in a sequential chain for the delays of "
"everyone ahead of them, which made the dashboard's 'Slowest Approver' "
"reliably name whoever sits last in the chain. Cleared when the row returns "
"to 'new' (reset-to-draft) and re-stamped on every re-entry, so a withdraw-"
"and-reopen cycle times the new decision window, not the original one."
msgstr ""

#. module: approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval.field_approval_category__group_approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval.field_approval_request__group_approval
msgid ""
"Where the request's approvers come from:\n"
"\n"
"        • Users: approvers are the ones listed below (plus the\n"
"          Employee's Manager and any matching tier, if configured)\n"
"        • Security group: approvers are exactly the members of the selected\n"
"          security group; the explicit user list is bypassed\n"
"\n"
"        Note:\n"
"        - The 'Minimum Approval' field applies to all resulting approvers\n"
"        - In 'Security group' mode approvers are ONLY the group members; the\n"
"          explicit list, the Employee's Manager and tiers are all bypassed\n"
"        - A user added by multiple mechanisms appears only once"
msgstr ""

